Both ReviewResult blocks carry `APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS` with two WARN items to address inline. Emitting task updates now.

```json
{"poe":"task:update","id":"t11","description":"Produces: written audit report confirming pass/fail for each of the 16 MN identifiers enumerated in must-nots.md. The stated count of 14 in must-nots.md §1 is a self-contradiction — audit against the full identifier list only. Verification methods: Network tab check (MN-SEC-01), source inspection (MN-SEC-02, MN-SEC-03, MN-PRIV-01, MN-PRIV-02, MN-PRIV-03, MN-ARCH-01, MN-ARCH-02, MN-ARCH-03, MN-SCOPE-01, MN-SCOPE-02), gameplay tests (MN-TRUST-01, MN-TRUST-02, MN-TRUST-03), cross-browser load (MN-QG-01), scoring algorithm verification (MN-QG-02). artifactType: test. estimatedHours: 2. acceptanceCriteria: All 16 identifiers explicitly listed and marked PASS — MN-SEC-01, MN-SEC-02, MN-SEC-03, MN-PRIV-01, MN-PRIV-02, MN-PRIV-03, MN-TRUST-01, MN-TRUST-02, MN-TRUST-03, MN-ARCH-01, MN-ARCH-02, MN-ARCH-03, MN-SCOPE-01, MN-SCOPE-02, MN-QG-01, MN-QG-02. Any FAIL is a blocker before t12."}
```

```json
{"poe":"task:update","id":"t6","description":"Produces: renderRow(rowIndex, scoreResults) that performs two distinct operations per tile: (a) tile.textContent = letter — sets the letter character using textContent (never innerHTML) per MN-SEC-03; (b) tile.classList.add('correct' | 'present' | 'absent') — applies color state via CSS class. Color classes ('correct', 'present', 'absent') must be defined in t1 (HTML skeleton) or t9 (CSS) before this task can be marked done — verify their presence before merging. artifactType: code. estimatedHours: 1. acceptanceCriteria: Each tile shows the guessed letter via textContent; correct-position tiles have class 'correct' (green), present tiles have 'present' (yellow), absent tiles have 'absent' (gray); no innerHTML assignment of user-derived content anywhere in this function; CSS color classes confirmed defined in t1 or t9."}
```

```json
{"poe":"done","summary":"Stage 1 plan approved with conditions addressed. 3 Epics, 9 Features, 12 Tasks, 19 dependency edges. Reviewer APPROVED_WITH_CONDITIONS. Two task updates applied: t11 acceptance criteria now enumerates all 16 MN identifiers explicitly (correcting the self-contradicting count of 14 in must-nots.md); t6 description now specifies both textContent (letter content) and classList (color state) as distinct required operations with explicit CSS class dependency check. Plan is ready for execution."}
```

